    "type": "game",
    "name": "Call from the darkness",
    "steam_appid": 3323830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A police officer receives an emergency call from a remote mountain town, and soon he will realize the dark secret that is hidden behind this town. You will have to advance through an atmosphere where you will only hear the sound of rain, wind and whispers of beings who are no longer human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dangers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to use your skills as a shooter to make your way through this town because along the way you will face enemies that will challenge your nerves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323830/extras/81359585d5b05e63a370166ffb0c051b.avif?t=1743340146\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to explore as much as you can since a medical kit, or one more cartridge of ammunition, will be the difference between staying alive or dying in the attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323830/extras/20728c6c8d4fd05ab7f0d1f82002f27d.avif?t=1743340146\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of elements of action, stealth, horror, survival and in a dark rural horror setting.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The particular atmosphere of loneliness in a dangerous place where time has stopped forever.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artistic direction that plays with the perspective of video and bodycam footage, of a policeman.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly Combat and Stealth You'll need to decide when to use stealth when up against a lot of enemies and when to use brute force.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A police officer receives an emergency call from a remote mountain town, and soon he will realize the dark secret that is hidden behind this town. You will have to advance through an atmosphere where you will only hear the sound of rain, wind and whispers of beings who are no longer human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dangers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to use your skills as a shooter to make your way through this town because along the way you will face enemies that will challenge your nerves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323830/extras/81359585d5b05e63a370166ffb0c051b.avif?t=1743340146\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to explore as much as you can since a medical kit, or one more cartridge of ammunition, will be the difference between staying alive or dying in the attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323830/extras/20728c6c8d4fd05ab7f0d1f82002f27d.avif?t=1743340146\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of elements of action, stealth, horror, survival and in a dark rural horror setting.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The particular atmosphere of loneliness in a dangerous place where time has stopped forever.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artistic direction that plays with the perspective of video and bodycam footage, of a policeman.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly Combat and Stealth You'll need to decide when to use stealth when up against a lot of enemies and when to use brute force.</p></li></ul>",
